<title>UK: Aerodata holds 21.5 pct of Scott Pickford.</title>
<headline>Aerodata holds 21.5 pct of Scott Pickford.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Aerodata Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it had an interest in 21.5 percent of British geoscience and engineering group Scott Pickford.</p>
<p>Aerodata said it now held or had irrevocable undertakings for 2,715,907 ordinary shares.</p>
<p>Aerodata said in December it intended to buy 2.5 million of Scott Pickford's shares at 48p each.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
